<title>USA: American Power Conversion Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>American Power Conversion Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WEST KINGSTON, R.I. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMERICAN POWER CONVERSION CORPORATION &amp; SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		 CONSOLIDATED CONDENSED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>					     FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>					    SEP 30, 1996   SEP 30, 1995</p>
<p>					    (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p> NET SALES				$193,755,373   $141,993,350</p>
<p> NET EARNINGS			     27,901,040     17,129,440</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE				.30		.18</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING</p>
<p>						94,401,094     93,765,475</p>
<p>					    FOR THE NINE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>					    SEP 30, 1996   SEP 30, 1995</p>
<p>					    (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p> NET SALES				$496,818,057   $373,747,703</p>
<p> NET EARNINGS			     62,218,862     52,779,799</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE				.66		.56</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING</p>
<p>						93,994,887     93,492,265</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
